WEBVTT

01:27.305 --> 01:28.345
LOVE & CROWN

01:28.425 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:31.105 --> 01:34.025
EPISODE 4

01:34.105 --> 01:35.105
We have an invitation.

01:35.185 --> 01:36.905
Please, go upstairs
to the Green Haitang Chamber.

01:37.505 --> 01:38.585
This young lady is a distinguished guest.

01:38.665 --> 01:39.705
Let her in.

01:42.105 --> 01:43.385
Please come with me.

01:45.345 --> 01:46.305
Let's go.

01:55.905 --> 01:58.545
Master, why did you let her in?

02:00.825 --> 02:02.985
Willow and haitang blossoms.

02:03.505 --> 02:04.825
She's one of us.

02:22.905 --> 02:23.905
Look.

02:34.785 --> 02:36.305
Sorry for the long wait.

02:36.385 --> 02:39.305
The highlight of our show today
will begin soon.

02:39.385 --> 02:42.745
You who come to this pleasure boat
must have already known the rules here.

02:42.825 --> 02:43.665
A blind auction.

02:43.745 --> 02:46.145
You each have three
haitang flowers on your table,

02:46.225 --> 02:47.665
representing three bidding chances.

02:47.745 --> 02:50.185
But let me put out a disclaimer now.

02:50.265 --> 02:52.465
If you bid but fail to pay,

02:53.265 --> 02:55.265
you'll be fed to the fish.

02:57.345 --> 02:59.825
-What are we bidding for today?
-I wonder.

02:59.905 --> 03:01.705
Allow me to start the bid.

03:01.785 --> 03:03.665
My starting price is 100 liang.

03:05.985 --> 03:06.825
200 liang.

03:07.785 --> 03:09.505
How can we bid when we don't know
what it is?

03:11.345 --> 03:12.345
400 liang.

03:13.025 --> 03:14.745
400 liang already? This soon?

03:14.825 --> 03:17.625
Mr. Niu offers 400 liang.

03:17.705 --> 03:19.305
Do I hear a higher bid?

03:25.865 --> 03:26.745
3,000 liang.

03:28.585 --> 03:30.145
-3,000?
-3,000?

03:33.465 --> 03:34.505
Are you out of your mind?

03:34.585 --> 03:36.225
How generous of this gentleman.

03:36.305 --> 03:37.465
3,000 liang.

03:37.545 --> 03:39.825
Any higher bids?

03:39.905 --> 03:40.985
5,000 liang.

03:42.265 --> 03:43.665
5,000 liang?

03:43.745 --> 03:44.865
5,000 liang?

03:47.305 --> 03:49.465
That's not fair.
He didn't throw the flower.

03:49.545 --> 03:51.025
Patience, my esteemed guest.

03:51.105 --> 03:53.225
Guests on the second floor,
in the Golden Haitang Chamber

03:53.305 --> 03:54.585
have special privileges,

03:54.665 --> 03:57.385
but they all have only three chances
as well.

04:01.185 --> 04:02.065
6,000 liang.

04:03.145 --> 04:04.705
-8,000 liang.
-8,000 liang?

04:12.745 --> 04:14.225
Enough is enough. Stop it.

04:14.305 --> 04:15.425
What if they feed you to the fish?

04:15.505 --> 04:16.865
Did you hear me?

04:25.705 --> 04:27.065
Two fluorite night pearls.

04:30.985 --> 04:33.105
Two fluorite night pearls.

04:33.185 --> 04:34.185
Fluorite night pearls.

04:39.505 --> 04:41.345
What an elucidating experience.

04:42.745 --> 04:44.425
That spoiled brat.

04:51.745 --> 04:53.985
What exquisite fluorite night pearls.
Fine tributes from the Western Sea.

04:54.065 --> 04:56.945
May I know where you hail from, Mr. Bai?

04:57.025 --> 04:58.465
This is just a transaction.

04:58.545 --> 05:00.785
Outside of this pleasure boat,
we're both strangers.

05:01.425 --> 05:03.545
Right. I agree.

05:05.625 --> 05:07.425
I wonder what it is
that my husband spent a fortune

05:07.505 --> 05:08.385
to purchase.

05:08.465 --> 05:09.785
When can we get it?

05:09.865 --> 05:12.225
You're so impatient, Miss. Come with me.

05:13.265 --> 05:14.105
After you.

05:14.625 --> 05:15.705
Wait for me here.

05:15.785 --> 05:17.425
I'd like to see a friend.

05:17.505 --> 05:19.225
A friend? Who?

05:35.105 --> 05:36.145
You're alone.

05:39.985 --> 05:41.345
Oh, my dear brother. Are you worried

05:41.425 --> 05:42.265
that I might feel lonely,

05:42.345 --> 05:44.465
so you came to have
a heart-to-heart talk with me?

05:44.545 --> 05:46.025
Someone tried to kill me when you learned

05:46.105 --> 05:47.985
that I joined Fenglai Pavilion.

05:48.065 --> 05:49.905
As my only brother,

05:49.985 --> 05:51.345
you sure want me dead.

05:53.665 --> 05:55.825
You think I tried to kill you?

05:58.665 --> 05:59.825
Are you implying

06:00.585 --> 06:02.105
that it was
your mother who wanted me dead,

06:02.705 --> 06:04.025
and you had no idea at all?

06:04.945 --> 06:06.665
Just like all the times before,

06:06.745 --> 06:08.585
it's always your mother who wants me dead,

06:08.665 --> 06:09.625
not you.

06:09.705 --> 06:11.225
Will you believe me if
I say I have nothing to do with it?

06:12.465 --> 06:14.345
Whether it's your or your mother's doing,

06:14.945 --> 06:16.345
it makes no difference.

06:24.625 --> 06:25.465
Right.

06:28.305 --> 06:30.585
You lured me to Botang Pleasure Boat.

06:32.185 --> 06:33.745
What if I kill you right now?

06:36.345 --> 06:37.625
Can you kill me though?

06:37.705 --> 06:39.145
I can try.

06:41.545 --> 06:42.985
I don't have time for a spar right now.

06:43.625 --> 06:46.585
Many kids on this boat are waiting
to be rescued.

06:47.265 --> 06:48.985
Drop your act.

06:49.065 --> 06:52.185
You forsook moral
principles for the throne.

06:52.265 --> 06:54.425
A human life is nothing in your eyes,

06:54.945 --> 06:56.465
let alone the lives of those kids.

06:56.545 --> 06:58.705
You only care about ruling Great Qi.

07:02.705 --> 07:03.785
Yes.

07:03.865 --> 07:05.225
I do care about our empire

07:05.305 --> 07:07.345
but I care more about
the lives of my subjects.

07:07.425 --> 07:09.505
Even if it's just one person,

07:09.585 --> 07:10.985
that person is still
a citizen of Great Qi.

07:11.585 --> 07:14.425
You're still
the sanctimonious Xiao Huan I know.

07:20.225 --> 07:21.465
You again?

07:24.585 --> 07:26.345
Why do you two always
fight when you see each other?

07:27.225 --> 07:28.625
I told you to wait for me there.

07:29.865 --> 07:31.065
I…

07:33.785 --> 07:34.985
We have to pick the goods.

08:10.945 --> 08:12.945
They are here. Help yourself.

08:14.825 --> 08:16.665
Are these murder thralls?

08:17.345 --> 08:19.305
Keen eyes, Mister.

08:19.385 --> 08:20.705
They are stone men.

08:20.785 --> 08:22.985
They are invincible and feel no pain,

08:23.065 --> 08:24.305
perfect for a killing machine.

08:25.585 --> 08:27.425
It's hard to make one,

08:27.505 --> 08:29.465
and that's why it's expensive.

08:30.705 --> 08:32.425
We only have 10 minutes to save them.

08:32.505 --> 08:33.745
After 10 minutes,

08:33.825 --> 08:35.465
Prince of Yuzhang will surround the boat.

08:35.545 --> 08:38.505
None of the passengers
will be able to escape.

08:45.665 --> 08:47.705
We want this one.

08:47.785 --> 08:49.545
Wise choice.

08:56.825 --> 08:58.025
There are small boats behind the boat.

08:58.705 --> 09:00.145
Someone will pick you up there.

09:00.745 --> 09:02.225
Protect yourself and take the kids away.

09:20.465 --> 09:21.305
Run!

09:27.745 --> 09:29.305
-Here.
-Mother!

09:29.385 --> 09:30.225
Careful.

09:30.305 --> 09:31.505
Careful.

09:41.785 --> 09:42.625
Here.

09:46.585 --> 09:47.425
Come.

09:47.505 --> 09:48.505
Take the kids away first.

09:48.585 --> 09:49.425
I'll save Bai.

09:57.985 --> 09:59.305
Why did you return?

09:59.385 --> 10:00.465
We fight together.

10:43.865 --> 10:44.985
Who are you?

10:45.065 --> 10:46.385
It doesn't matter.

10:46.465 --> 10:47.705
What you need to know

10:47.785 --> 10:50.145
is that he is not for you to kill.

11:02.945 --> 11:04.345
It's too late.

11:05.105 --> 11:06.425
Surrender yourself now.

11:19.665 --> 11:20.785
You came nonetheless.

11:20.865 --> 11:22.985
It is my feudal land.

11:23.065 --> 11:25.465
If someone wants to commit
an atrocious crime on my land,

11:25.545 --> 11:27.505
they'll have to get through me,
Prince of Yuzhang.

11:31.505 --> 11:33.105
Enemy vessels are
three zhang away from our boat.

11:33.185 --> 11:34.465
The boat must be destroyed.

11:36.345 --> 11:37.665
Long live Lingbi.

11:37.745 --> 11:38.825
We give our lives to you.

11:39.665 --> 11:40.665
Long live Lingbi.

11:40.745 --> 11:42.105
We give our lives to you.

11:42.185 --> 11:43.305
Long live Lingbi.

11:43.385 --> 11:44.705
We give our lives to you.

11:44.785 --> 11:47.025
Long live Lingbi.
We give our lives to you.

11:47.105 --> 11:49.785
Long live Lingbi.
We give our lives to you.

11:49.865 --> 11:50.825
Long live Lingbi.

11:50.905 --> 11:51.865
-We give our lives to you.
-Run!

11:51.945 --> 11:54.665
Long live Lingbi.
We give our lives to you.

11:54.745 --> 11:57.265
Long live Lingbi.
We give our lives to you.

12:35.945 --> 12:39.305
FENGLAI PAVILION

12:39.385 --> 12:41.985
Miss Ling,
you merely suffered from the shock,

12:42.065 --> 12:43.305
so you're fine.

12:43.825 --> 12:45.145
He, however,
got the short end of the stick.

12:45.665 --> 12:48.025
His back is seriously wounded,
and he is suffering from nightmares.

12:48.785 --> 12:50.665
We don't know when he'll wake up.

12:55.825 --> 12:57.945
Bai. I'm sorry.

12:58.705 --> 13:00.025
Please be all right.

13:00.825 --> 13:01.905
What a joke.

13:01.985 --> 13:02.945
What a joke.

13:03.025 --> 13:04.985
You want to regain your power?

13:05.065 --> 13:06.465
Have you forgotten

13:06.545 --> 13:09.025
that you gave it to
us willingly in the past?

13:13.665 --> 13:14.945
Your Highness.

13:19.305 --> 13:20.705
It is cold out here,

13:20.785 --> 13:22.825
and you have a weak constitution.

13:22.905 --> 13:25.665
Why are you standing here alone?

13:31.865 --> 13:34.065
Don't do this, Your Highness.

13:34.145 --> 13:34.985
Come.

13:39.785 --> 13:40.625
If one day,

13:40.705 --> 13:42.305
I become the emperor,

13:42.385 --> 13:44.065
I shall make you the Grand Chancellor,

13:44.145 --> 13:45.825
and Cangcang the empress.

13:46.825 --> 13:49.625
The Empress Dowager
never takes His Highness seriously.

13:49.705 --> 13:51.625
His Highness is isolated politically.

13:51.705 --> 13:54.345
It is shrewd of him to form
an alliance with the Grand Tutor.

13:55.145 --> 13:57.385
But should he become
the emperor in the future,

13:57.465 --> 14:00.265
this promise might be
the one thing that binds him.

14:00.345 --> 14:01.185
Indeed.

14:04.625 --> 14:05.905
Grand Tutor Ling,

14:05.985 --> 14:07.345
when will you let me rule in my own right?

14:08.025 --> 14:09.345
The day Cangcang weds you

14:09.425 --> 14:11.665
will be the day you take real power.

14:11.745 --> 14:14.745
Unfortunately,
you might not live to see that day.

14:14.825 --> 14:15.945
Isn't it great to be the Bai Chifan

14:16.025 --> 14:18.225
who roams freely in the martial world?

14:18.865 --> 14:20.225
If I lose my power,

14:20.985 --> 14:22.145
I'll lose my life too.

14:24.745 --> 14:25.905
I will treat Cangcang with sincerity.

14:27.025 --> 14:29.185
Your sincerity is a joke.

14:29.265 --> 14:31.705
What a lovestruck ruler!

14:31.785 --> 14:33.065
Not only did
you fail to regain your power,

14:33.145 --> 14:35.105
but you will live like you used to before,

14:35.185 --> 14:36.705
wondering every day

14:36.785 --> 14:39.385
if you can live to
see the sunrise tomorrow.

14:40.505 --> 14:42.145
You lay low for ten years,

14:42.225 --> 14:43.585
but you messed up
your plan in one crucial moment.

14:44.185 --> 14:47.665
You brought this upon yourself.

14:49.345 --> 14:50.185
No.

14:50.825 --> 14:54.385
No. What should I do? This can't be it.

14:54.465 --> 14:55.465
Bai.

14:59.985 --> 15:01.665
Bai. You're finally awake.

15:07.385 --> 15:08.625
Cangcang.

15:08.705 --> 15:09.745
Marry me.

15:11.825 --> 15:12.825
What?

15:12.905 --> 15:15.145
Cangcang. I love you.

15:15.745 --> 15:17.585
Marry me. All right?

15:36.465 --> 15:37.385
Luo.

15:39.865 --> 15:40.905
Cangcang.

15:40.985 --> 15:42.905
Father wants me
to bring you back to the Capital.

15:42.985 --> 15:44.105
Come with me.

15:46.985 --> 15:47.985
Let Cangcang go already.

15:48.065 --> 15:49.985
I'm going to marry Cangcang.

16:04.185 --> 16:05.665
Luo, don't hurt Bai.

16:05.745 --> 16:07.105
Cangcang.

16:07.185 --> 16:08.945
Since the beginning,
he approached you to fulfill his plan.

16:09.025 --> 16:10.265
He has an agenda.

16:10.345 --> 16:11.545
I know very well if
he has an agenda or not.

16:11.625 --> 16:12.825
Someone with a secret agenda

16:12.905 --> 16:14.105
will not risk their lives to
save me again and again.

16:14.705 --> 16:15.665
Cangcang.

16:16.185 --> 16:17.345
He did that to earn your sympathy.

16:17.425 --> 16:18.585
Can't you tell?

16:18.665 --> 16:19.785
Luo.

16:19.865 --> 16:21.785
I can tell if it's a ruse
to earn my sympathy,

16:21.865 --> 16:22.785
or if he truly cares about me.

16:23.465 --> 16:26.345
You'd rather believe
a stranger you just met than me?

16:26.425 --> 16:27.465
I…

16:30.785 --> 16:31.825
I didn't mean it that way.

16:32.545 --> 16:33.585
Do you…

16:35.265 --> 16:36.185
Do you fancy him as well?

16:46.825 --> 16:48.985
Father wants me to bring you back.

16:49.065 --> 16:50.185
Don't make my job difficult for me.

16:55.865 --> 16:56.985
Luo.

16:57.065 --> 16:58.865
Headstrong as I may be,
I dare not defy my father.

17:00.425 --> 17:01.945
Give me three days.

17:02.025 --> 17:02.905
Once I settle everything,

17:02.985 --> 17:04.505
I'll see my father
and ask for a punishment.

17:04.585 --> 17:05.704
But today,

17:06.505 --> 17:07.345
you're not hurting Bai.

17:24.665 --> 17:27.905
FENGLAI PAVILION

17:30.505 --> 17:31.385
I'm coming.

17:33.425 --> 17:34.265
Bai?

17:36.785 --> 17:37.625
What is this?

17:39.065 --> 17:40.825
-A gift.
-A gift?

17:44.185 --> 17:45.025
Frostflame Iron?

17:45.945 --> 17:47.585
Give this to your master.

17:48.825 --> 17:49.665
Cangcang,

17:50.305 --> 17:51.225
if I want your hand in marriage,

17:51.305 --> 17:53.225
I'll have to earn
your father's and master's recognition.

17:53.825 --> 17:56.705
I don't want to see any tension
between you and them because of me.

17:56.785 --> 17:59.385
So let's pay your master a visit.

18:03.865 --> 18:05.225
I'm sure he'll be over the moon.

18:05.305 --> 18:07.345
Among all things, he loves
making swords the most.

18:09.545 --> 18:12.505
Doesn't this belong to Prince of Yuzhang?
Why do you have it?

18:16.425 --> 18:19.705
HEROIC COMPOSURE

18:19.785 --> 18:21.305
Frostflame Iron?

18:22.705 --> 18:24.465
It's mine.

18:24.545 --> 18:25.785
Why must I give it to you?

18:27.545 --> 18:29.065
Botang Pleasure Boat was destroyed.

18:29.585 --> 18:31.185
The Lingbi Sect
suffers another great loss.

18:31.985 --> 18:34.505
You also solved
the case of the missing boys.

18:34.585 --> 18:36.785
I'm sure the imperial court
will reward you handsomely.

18:37.305 --> 18:38.585
You don't need the Frostflame Iron.

18:41.025 --> 18:43.425
I can give it to you for free.

18:44.025 --> 18:45.065
But only if you…

18:46.665 --> 18:47.865
If I?

18:49.665 --> 18:52.945
I'm afraid you can't give me what I want.

19:00.345 --> 19:02.585
Don't covet what isn't yours.

19:07.065 --> 19:08.065
Give me the Frostflame Iron.

19:09.385 --> 19:11.785
Are you ordering me as the emperor

19:12.425 --> 19:14.385
or are you pleading as my brother?

19:16.425 --> 19:17.305
What do you think?

19:30.385 --> 19:31.225
Whatever.

19:32.345 --> 19:33.745
I saved you twice in the quarry

19:34.545 --> 19:35.665
and on the boat.

19:37.225 --> 19:38.785
I will ask you to pay me back

19:39.705 --> 19:41.465
for those favors eventually.

19:46.985 --> 19:48.425
Consider this iron ore

19:48.945 --> 19:51.905
my gift to you for your upcoming wedding.

19:55.545 --> 19:56.385
Thank you.

20:04.625 --> 20:05.865
Bai, wait for me.

20:11.545 --> 20:12.385
Cangcang.

20:13.065 --> 20:14.545
Didn't you say your master is a swordsman?

20:14.625 --> 20:17.145
I thought a swordsman would
go on an adventure to uphold justice.

20:17.225 --> 20:18.265
Why is your master

20:18.345 --> 20:20.305
residing in this remote area?

20:21.545 --> 20:24.065
He was a swordsman,
and now, he's a recluse.

20:24.145 --> 20:26.625
Because
he doesn't like the hustle and bustle.

20:28.385 --> 20:29.465
How did you meet your master then?

20:31.145 --> 20:34.825
Did I tell you
why I wanted to rescue those kids?

20:37.905 --> 20:38.825
When I was little…

20:38.905 --> 20:40.185
Father!

20:40.745 --> 20:43.905
I miss Mother. Can we visit her grave?

20:43.985 --> 20:45.105
Cangcang.

20:45.185 --> 20:46.625
I'm busy.

20:46.705 --> 20:48.745
Quit making a fuss. Go back now.

20:48.825 --> 20:52.105
No. I don't want to stay home alone.

20:52.825 --> 20:53.945
Cangcang.

20:54.705 --> 20:55.745
Be a good girl.

20:56.345 --> 20:59.505
We will visit her grave in the future.

21:01.385 --> 21:02.905
Bring her back.

21:02.985 --> 21:04.505
Find some playmates for her.

21:05.265 --> 21:06.225
Go back now.

21:11.625 --> 21:14.265
Slow down, Young Lady!

21:14.345 --> 21:15.665
Don't trip yourself.

21:21.825 --> 21:22.745
If you won't bring me there,

21:22.825 --> 21:24.705
I'll go there myself.

21:38.545 --> 21:40.865
Try running now. Run!

21:41.465 --> 21:43.105
I'll spank you.

21:43.185 --> 21:45.025
Father will save me!

21:45.585 --> 21:46.865
Run! Try running.

21:47.625 --> 21:48.985
-He'll save me.
-Come out!

21:49.065 --> 21:51.825
My father is the best father in the world!

21:55.265 --> 21:57.985
You had similar experiences,

21:58.065 --> 22:00.425
so you hate those who traffic children.

22:06.705 --> 22:08.305
What does this have
to do with your master?

22:11.225 --> 22:13.665
Mercy, sir.
I've not seen this girl before.

22:13.745 --> 22:16.025
I'm serious, sir.

22:16.105 --> 22:17.985
Just take that girl away.

22:18.065 --> 22:19.425
For free.

22:25.425 --> 22:27.305
Don't be scared. Let me help you.

22:32.025 --> 22:33.785
Easy now. I'll take you home, all right?

22:36.145 --> 22:37.385
I'm not a bad guy.

22:38.585 --> 22:40.105
Tell me.

22:40.185 --> 22:41.345
What is your name?

22:42.705 --> 22:44.745
-And then?
-And then,

22:45.625 --> 22:47.545
Master brought me to my father.

22:47.625 --> 22:50.545
My father hugged me and cried.

22:50.625 --> 22:51.465
Master also told Father

22:51.545 --> 22:53.985
that his daughter
had suffered the same fate,

22:54.065 --> 22:56.305
and that he had been looking for her.

22:56.385 --> 22:57.625
Did he manage to find her?

23:01.465 --> 23:02.585
It's over there.

23:03.785 --> 23:06.425
Master told me
that she loved haitang blossoms the most.

23:06.505 --> 23:08.105
Even though I have never met her,

23:08.185 --> 23:09.025
I'm sure

23:09.625 --> 23:11.545
she missed her father

23:11.625 --> 23:13.025
and this wonderful world a lot.

23:13.105 --> 23:14.825
TOMBSTONE OF BELOVED DAUGHTER,
LI XIAOTANG

23:17.505 --> 23:18.865
So later,

23:20.305 --> 23:21.865
I made the decision

23:22.745 --> 23:24.265
that even though
Master had lost her daughter,

23:25.145 --> 23:27.865
I would treat him as if he were my father.

23:31.665 --> 23:32.505
Bai.

23:33.465 --> 23:35.545
You will treat Master with kindness,
won't you?

23:42.265 --> 23:43.985
TOMBSTONE OF BELOVED DAUGHTER,
LI XIAOTANG

23:44.065 --> 23:45.345
Master, I'm here.

23:46.225 --> 23:47.305
Master.

23:47.385 --> 23:48.585
I'm here to visit you.

23:53.385 --> 23:54.665
Master.

23:56.785 --> 23:57.945
I'm here to visit you.

23:59.465 --> 24:00.585
Where did he go?

24:06.985 --> 24:08.225
What are you doing here?

24:08.305 --> 24:09.785
I'm here to see Cangcang's master.

24:09.865 --> 24:11.145
You're not welcome here.

24:12.145 --> 24:14.025
Are you saying that as Cangcang's master,

24:14.825 --> 24:16.305
or as the Ghost King?

24:20.105 --> 24:22.265
As expected of
a student of Grand Tutor Ling.

24:22.945 --> 24:25.865
Do you know
what your teacher thinks of you?

24:26.465 --> 24:28.825
He said you were like a wolf pup

24:28.905 --> 24:31.145
prowling in the snow.

24:31.225 --> 24:34.145
People assume you're alone and powerless.

24:34.225 --> 24:35.945
But they seem to forget

24:38.745 --> 24:41.825
that you are still a wolf.

24:50.225 --> 24:51.065
Master!

24:51.785 --> 24:53.145
You're here.

24:53.225 --> 24:54.305
I was looking for you.

24:55.425 --> 24:56.425
Greetings, sir.

24:58.585 --> 25:00.065
I see you have talked to him.

25:00.145 --> 25:01.905
-Allow me to introduce…
-No need.

25:01.985 --> 25:03.425
We met just now.

25:05.025 --> 25:08.665
Then, about our marriage…

25:10.905 --> 25:13.105
I am just a farmer now.

25:13.185 --> 25:15.465
Your father should have the final say.

25:15.545 --> 25:16.585
What do you mean?

25:16.665 --> 25:18.585
You're as important to me as my father.

25:19.465 --> 25:20.745
I trust your judgment.

25:20.825 --> 25:21.865
Cangcang,

25:21.945 --> 25:24.745
Bai Chifan told me
that you came to have a sword made.

25:24.825 --> 25:27.185
Quick. Give me the Frostflame Iron.

26:15.465 --> 26:16.665
Your Majesty,

26:16.745 --> 26:18.265
I found something
important whilst investigating

26:18.345 --> 26:19.785
Grand Tutor Ling.

26:19.865 --> 26:21.225
Ling Cangcang's master is likely

26:21.305 --> 26:22.865
to be the Ghost King.

26:24.025 --> 26:24.905
Likely, you said?

26:24.985 --> 26:28.425
Don't you know how important he is
to Cangcang?

26:28.505 --> 26:29.865
I can capture Li Lu

26:29.945 --> 26:31.705
and interrogate him before we decide.

26:31.785 --> 26:33.105
No need for that.

26:33.185 --> 26:35.625
If I want Cangcang to marry me,
I must pay him a visit.

26:36.585 --> 26:38.025
If he turns out to be the Ghost King,

26:38.545 --> 26:40.945
we can only act on a full moon's night.

26:51.265 --> 26:52.305
Bai.

26:53.225 --> 26:54.785
What are you doing out here?

26:54.865 --> 26:55.825
I'm here to get some fresh air.

26:57.105 --> 26:58.665
Did you know?

26:58.745 --> 27:00.825
Master never lets
anyone into his sword cottage.

27:00.905 --> 27:03.945
But he lets you in.
That means you've earned his recognition.

27:09.425 --> 27:10.585
What's wrong?

27:13.905 --> 27:15.625
The full moon's night is near.

27:18.665 --> 27:19.505
Indeed.

27:20.025 --> 27:23.225
It feels like the moon here
is prettier than anywhere else.

27:25.745 --> 27:26.985
In the past,

27:27.065 --> 27:28.705
Master would never
allow me to admire the moon

27:28.785 --> 27:29.905
on a full moon's night.

27:30.905 --> 27:32.385
But tomorrow is a full moon's night

27:33.145 --> 27:34.705
and the day we'll get our swords.

27:35.425 --> 27:38.025
I hope he won't chase me away this time.

27:47.465 --> 27:48.545
Cangcang.

27:49.865 --> 27:51.625
I pray that you won't resent me.

28:37.065 --> 28:37.905
Is it done?

28:38.745 --> 28:39.585
Yes.

28:41.225 --> 28:42.545
Cangcang. Take a look.

28:55.345 --> 28:56.225
What an amazing blade.

29:12.305 --> 29:13.265
Master,

29:14.145 --> 29:15.025
it is a good sword.

29:15.665 --> 29:18.785
If that is your choice,
you should now name it.

29:26.945 --> 29:29.345
Master, I have already thought it through.

29:29.945 --> 29:31.785
Can we call it Willow?

29:43.065 --> 29:44.185
Of course.

29:45.425 --> 29:46.545
Thanks, Master.

29:56.745 --> 29:57.585
Bai Chifan,

29:57.665 --> 29:59.065
you can have this sword.

30:00.945 --> 30:02.945
Master, you should give it a name.

30:07.625 --> 30:08.585
The dragon hasn't soared high,

30:09.185 --> 30:10.785
but his reign can already be felt.

30:12.825 --> 30:15.265
This blade shall be called Rex.

30:17.305 --> 30:20.105
Rex and Willow.

30:20.945 --> 30:22.185
Those are good names.

30:26.945 --> 30:30.505
Consider these two blades

30:31.185 --> 30:32.345
my gifts to your wedding.

30:56.305 --> 30:58.025
Bai, thank my master already.

30:59.865 --> 31:00.905
Thank you for the sword, sir.

31:07.945 --> 31:09.105
Thank you, Master.

31:37.145 --> 31:38.065
You're here.

31:39.665 --> 31:41.465
Is Cangcang asleep already?

31:42.265 --> 31:45.625
Without her chattering, it feels quiet.

31:46.265 --> 31:48.425
You shouldn't have stayed here tonight.

31:48.505 --> 31:50.225
I'm sure your men

31:50.305 --> 31:52.105
are all around this sword grave.

31:52.625 --> 31:55.105
You have already noticed my plan,

31:55.185 --> 31:57.145
yet you decided to stay.

31:57.225 --> 31:58.545
Are you surrendering yourself?

31:59.985 --> 32:01.985
Do you know why

32:02.065 --> 32:05.065
Cangcang named the blade Willow?

32:06.425 --> 32:07.385
My daughter

32:07.465 --> 32:09.825
was playing house with
the kids from the same village.

32:10.345 --> 32:11.585
She loved to pretend to be a heroine.

32:11.665 --> 32:12.985
She went out to play all the time,

32:13.985 --> 32:17.145
and pestered me
to make her a wooden sword.

32:18.065 --> 32:20.865
Your sword is the best
sword in the world, Father.

32:20.945 --> 32:21.905
Thank you, Father.

32:21.985 --> 32:24.305
Should we give the sword a name?

32:24.385 --> 32:25.465
Sure!

32:27.305 --> 32:30.225
That day when I found my daughter,
I saw a mountain full of cadavers.

32:31.025 --> 32:32.785
All I could find of her

32:33.585 --> 32:35.465
was a mangled hand.

32:35.545 --> 32:36.865
That hand

32:38.665 --> 32:40.585
was clinging to the wooden sword tightly

32:42.545 --> 32:43.745
but she…

32:45.545 --> 32:46.745
She was gone.

32:47.985 --> 32:50.305
I held her hands

32:52.425 --> 32:56.905
and carved the name, Willow, on it

32:58.185 --> 33:01.425
by guiding her step by step.

33:03.025 --> 33:04.585
Breeze passes
through the willow tree softly.

33:04.665 --> 33:05.985
The moon shines on the haitang blossoms.

33:06.065 --> 33:07.985
So you know

33:09.065 --> 33:10.185
the complete codes.

33:10.865 --> 33:12.265
On Botang Pleasure Boat,

33:12.865 --> 33:13.785
when Jin Haitang

33:13.865 --> 33:15.265
saw the haitang blossom
pendant on Cangcang's waist,

33:16.025 --> 33:17.745
she let us into the auction.

33:17.825 --> 33:21.105
I suppose the pendant
was left behind by your daughter.

33:28.145 --> 33:30.305
You are indeed using Cangcang.

33:31.145 --> 33:31.985
She's such a sweet girl.

33:32.065 --> 33:33.825
How could you…

33:35.145 --> 33:38.425
So the Ghost King has empathy?

33:39.145 --> 33:41.305
Why did you lead the Lingbi Sect

33:41.385 --> 33:43.065
and commit inhumane crimes then?

33:43.145 --> 33:45.745
Factors out of our control often bind us.

33:45.825 --> 33:47.865
The Ghost King is but a puppet.

33:47.945 --> 33:50.185
I don't think myself morally perfect.

33:51.105 --> 33:53.825
I seek vengeance and repay gratitude.

33:56.505 --> 33:58.305
But why give your life away now?

33:58.985 --> 34:00.225
Come to the palace with me and repent.

34:00.945 --> 34:02.385
You will bring solace to everyone.

34:12.304 --> 34:13.585
Heed my warning.

34:14.145 --> 34:15.824
Stop pestering the Lingbi Sect.

34:16.344 --> 34:18.105
If I don't die, there will be no peace.

34:19.625 --> 34:21.225
So make it quick.

34:22.225 --> 34:23.545
Alas, what a cruel joke from life.

34:23.625 --> 34:25.425
Keep the truth from Cangcang.

34:28.025 --> 34:29.505
A promise from the emperor

34:31.945 --> 34:33.905
shall never be broken.

34:43.824 --> 34:44.905
Do it.

35:02.145 --> 35:03.265
Master!

35:10.905 --> 35:11.945
Master!

35:15.425 --> 35:16.585
Master!

35:25.425 --> 35:27.225
Master!

35:28.985 --> 35:30.025
Master!

35:30.665 --> 35:32.785
Wake up, Master!

36:11.665 --> 36:13.225
Tell me why.

36:19.585 --> 36:22.105
Why?

36:37.545 --> 36:39.985
My intervention was tardy.
Forgive me, Your Majesty.

36:59.185 --> 37:00.705
What did he just call you?

37:16.785 --> 37:18.065
You killed my master.

37:18.145 --> 37:19.465
Why would I marry you?

37:20.985 --> 37:22.705
I want you to marry me willingly.

37:22.785 --> 37:27.185
I, Ling Cangcang, am willing to marry you.

37:29.105 --> 37:30.305
Who are you?

37:30.385 --> 37:33.745
Ling Cangcang or the Empress of Great Qi?

37:33.825 --> 37:35.665
Do you love the Emperor of Great Qi?

37:36.185 --> 37:38.825
Bai Chifan never existed.

37:39.425 --> 37:40.465
Bai Chifan…

37:47.425 --> 37:50.905
Bai Chifan never existed.

37:55.985 --> 37:57.985
My dear. You're awake.

38:01.505 --> 38:02.625
Your Majesty.

38:07.305 --> 38:08.345
How come you're here, Your Majesty?

38:10.945 --> 38:14.225
I came in
and heard you talking in your dream.

38:15.425 --> 38:16.465
Are you all right?

38:17.705 --> 38:18.985
I…

38:21.105 --> 38:22.145
I had a dream.

38:24.425 --> 38:25.465
What is it about?

38:26.425 --> 38:27.665
I dreamed that…

38:35.745 --> 38:36.865
I dreamed that…

38:38.545 --> 38:40.345
I dreamed that you were kind,

38:41.385 --> 38:44.265
and that my master was still alive.

38:44.905 --> 38:48.585
And I was still the carefree soul.

38:51.345 --> 38:53.665
-My dear…
-Alas, a dream is the opposite of reality.

38:56.625 --> 38:58.305
My master is dead.

39:10.265 --> 39:11.505
Your Majesty, it's time to wake up.

39:11.585 --> 39:13.625
Today is the day you return home.

39:15.505 --> 39:16.545
Come in.

39:23.025 --> 39:23.865
Your Majesty.

39:27.065 --> 39:28.945
Since you have to return home today,

39:29.825 --> 39:31.065
I understand it might be tiring.

39:31.585 --> 39:33.905
So I will go back to
the Grand Chancellor's Manor with you.

39:34.945 --> 39:35.985
What do you think?

39:37.105 --> 39:38.705
You are a busy man, Your Majesty.

39:38.785 --> 39:41.305
I shouldn't burden you
with such a trivial matter.

39:44.705 --> 39:48.425
Your matter is not a trivial matter to me.

39:53.385 --> 39:54.705
I wouldn't want to impose.

40:18.105 --> 40:19.305
Relax, my dear.

40:20.185 --> 40:21.745
This is a wedding gift
from the young general,

40:22.345 --> 40:23.745
Ling Jueding.

40:24.345 --> 40:28.825
It took me a while to locate it.

40:29.545 --> 40:32.145
My dear, you may take a look.

40:42.865 --> 40:44.305
How thoughtful of General Ling.

40:45.265 --> 40:47.545
He couldn't attend
our wedding in the Capital,

40:47.625 --> 40:49.945
yet he gave us such a meaningful gift.

40:52.225 --> 40:54.425
He is stationed in Jiangzhou.

40:55.225 --> 40:57.105
I can only imagine the pain
he feels from being away from his family.

40:58.265 --> 41:00.705
Maybe it'll be less miserable

41:01.305 --> 41:03.625
if he
can secure a position in the Capital.

41:09.705 --> 41:11.065
My dear.

41:11.145 --> 41:13.305
You must think about
the ones who are still alive.

41:21.185 --> 41:22.665
Jueding is brave, strong,

41:23.185 --> 41:24.745
and straightforward.

41:24.825 --> 41:26.545
He should be a soldier.

41:26.625 --> 41:27.625
If…

41:32.665 --> 41:34.865
If we find him a desk job in the Capital,

41:35.585 --> 41:37.025
I'm sure he'd hate

41:38.345 --> 41:39.665
that kind of lifestyle.

41:42.585 --> 41:43.665
You're right, my dear.

41:44.625 --> 41:45.905
I didn't think of that.

41:45.985 --> 41:47.385
In that case…

41:47.465 --> 41:48.465
I turned your offer down,

41:48.545 --> 41:50.585
thinking that you'd be
too busy to come with me.

41:51.945 --> 41:52.985
But if

41:54.905 --> 41:57.465
you are willing to come home with me,

41:59.105 --> 42:00.745
I'll be extremely delighted.

42:02.665 --> 42:03.505
Good.

42:04.385 --> 42:07.025
Then I shall wait for you outside.

43:25.385 --> 43:27.945
Do you think
His Majesty loves Her Majesty?

43:28.585 --> 43:29.585
What are you on about?

43:30.105 --> 43:30.985
After they got married,

43:31.065 --> 43:33.225
His Majesty hasn't
consummated with Her Majesty.

43:33.305 --> 43:34.465
Everyone in the palace

43:34.545 --> 43:36.465
is saying that His Majesty
only married Her Majesty

43:37.065 --> 43:38.345
for political reasons.

43:39.465 --> 43:40.945
But seeing

43:41.025 --> 43:43.265
His Majesty go back
home with Her Majesty today,

43:43.785 --> 43:46.385
I feel that he does love her.

44:22.185 --> 44:24.265
LING MANOR

44:26.825 --> 44:27.945
Let's go.
